From 6f3b6d343dfe2ffc71087727cfbeef997d71fa8a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Codex Unleashed <codex-unleashed@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 24 Oct 2026 05:18:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] test: Isolate command-center defaults from host-managed
 requirements

The destination-default test owns its server configuration but loaded system requirements. A host fast_mode=false requirement strips the bundled model's priority tier and correctly sends default, contradicting this unrelated fixture's priority assertion.

Use the existing managed-config isolation helper while retaining the fixture's explicit user config. Production requirement enforcement and all request assertions remain unchanged.

RED: the exact remote-null-fast assertion fails with host fast_mode=false, recording gpt-6.1-sol with no supported tiers and serviceTier=default.
GREEN: the maintained focused TUI check passes without retries after isolation. The integrated TUI library suite passes 5809 tests with four existing skips, native TTY, short outside-Git TMPDIR, and NO_COLOR unset. Standalone emitted formatting is a separate required gate.
---
 codex-rs/tui/src/app/tests/background_task_defaults_tests.rs | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/codex-rs/tui/src/app/tests/background_task_defaults_tests.rs b/codex-rs/tui/src/app/tests/background_task_defaults_tests.rs
index 438ce760..fe02e14c 100644
--- a/codex-rs/tui/src/app/tests/background_task_defaults_tests.rs
+++ b/codex-rs/tui/src/app/tests/background_task_defaults_tests.rs
@@ -317,7 +317,7 @@ async fn command_center_new_reads_server_defaults_for_actual_destination() -> Re
             thread_mode,
             LoaderOverrides {
                 user_config_path: Some(server_home.path().join("config.toml").abs()),
-                ..LoaderOverrides::default()
+                ..LoaderOverrides::without_managed_config_for_tests()
             },
         )
         .await?;
